{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "09d5d9bd-8046-81c5-9cc3-4e17a8af5eab",
  "created_at": "2025-12-31T11:55:24-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Moira Gallagher",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:51:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:51:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Denise. Please excuse me, I am on the speaker because I am in my car. I am parked outside the grocery store. Can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:51:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:51:54-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Please, I would like to report the storm drain in front of my house. It is making a noise, like a grunting, and it is very slow. When there is a thaw, the water comes back up out of it into the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:52:12-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it raining right now, or is this just from the melting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:52:18-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no rain. Nothing like that. It is dry now. But when the snow melts, or any big rain, it backs up. My neighbor tells me it happens every big rain, for years. So it is not new. [pause] It is very frustrating, because nobody fixes it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:52:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:52:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please, it is 95 Bridge Street, in The Point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:52:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "95 Bridge Street. And the drain's right out front of the house, on the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:52:52-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, on the street, right in front. The water sits there, and it goes toward the sidewalk. [line breaks up] Sorry, there is a truck next to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:53:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I got most of that. Is the water getting into your yard or the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:53:12-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not into the house, thank God. But it covers the edge of the street and it smells bad. Please tell me, will you open a work order? And for what date?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:53:25-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll put in a work order now so a crew can look at that drain and see if it's clogged or if there's something deeper going on. As for a date, it depends on the schedule. I'd say they usually get to these within a week or two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:53:45-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A week or two. Please, I have been waiting a long time already, for many winters. Can you write that it happens every time, so they know it is not one day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:53:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note that it's recurring, and that your neighbor says it happens with every heavy rain. That helps them know it's a pattern."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:54:08-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. That is good. And if nobody comes, who do I call? Please, I do not want to wait and nothing happens again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:54:19-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Call this same line and give me or whoever answers the address, and we'll check on the work order. Can I get a callback number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:54:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. It is 401-555-0168."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:54:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0168. Got it. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:54:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Moira Gallagher. G-A-L-L-A-G-H-E-R."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:54:41-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. Gallagher. So that's the drain in front of 95 Bridge Street, slow and backing up on thaws and heavy rain, recurring, no storm right now. Did I get it right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:54:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. Please, one more thing, will someone call me when it is done?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:55:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll ask them to. If you haven't heard anything in a couple of weeks, call back and we'll look it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:55:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you for your help, Denise. I hope that this time they come."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:55:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll get it in right now. Happy New Year, Ms. Gallagher."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T11:55:22-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
